### Blog Management System — API Tests

### 1. Register a user
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "reza",
  "email": "reza@example.com",
  "password": "Reza123456"
}

###

### 2. Login
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "reza",
  "password": "Reza123456"
}

###

### 3. Get all posts
GET http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Get a post by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Create a post
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My First Blog Post",
  "content": "This is my first post in the Blog Management System."
}

###

### 6. Update a post
PUT http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Blog Post",
  "content": "This post has been updated successfully."
}

###

### 7. Delete a post
DELETE http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts/1

###

### 8. Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/logout
